{"script":"m_1_4_2","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唔……现在我们也知道该找谁了。接下来怎么办？立刻去探路吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]观星高地……荒野的北部边缘……要到达那里的话，得先去西北边的修行所……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[show]修行所？你们要去那个神神叨叨的家伙们聚集的修行所？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[show]哈，我劝你们还是多等几天吧！现在过去可是在送命啊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊？等等，你是谁啊，不要突然就凑过来啊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[show]我可是好心提醒你们。这几天外面[color=f1401c]到处都是魔物[colorEnd]，所有的道路都被截断了。[r][l]你们还想到那么远的地方去，可不是一头扎到魔物嘴里嘛！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这也是异变的影响吗？","tag":"tag_8"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[cm][show]那我就不知道了。不过我听说，驿站正在召集契约者，试着打通道路、收复失地，最后一站就是那座修行所。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[show]这次可是由那位明星契约者的[color=ffb64d]迦南[colorEnd]大人带队！[r][l]应该要不了几天，那些可恨的魔物就会被一扫而光了吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"食客","text":"[show]所以我让你们多等几天，等尘埃落定了再上路不好吗？何必现在顶着风头出门呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唔。他是这么说的，你觉得呢？[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我不想光这么等着。","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]我也是这么觉得的。不过，要真像刚刚那人说的一样，光靠我们两个人也闯不过去吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]你说……如果不是两个人不就可以了？“驿站正在召集契约者打通道路”……[r]嗯，刚刚那人确实说过——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哦我懂了！你是准备混到契约者的队伍里，跟着他们一起去观星高地对吧！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我们也是契约者，可以加入他们。","tag":"tag_15"},{"text":"我们去找艾尔莎，承接契约。","tag":"tag_15"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]啊对对对，是加入！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]对啊，跟着大部队不光安全有保证，还不用干等，可以第一时间前往修行所！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]就是这么一来，总感觉好像又是在给驿站打工，稍微有点不爽……[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"要不你反过来想想？","tag":"tag_18"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嗯？你说我们这不是在给驿站打工，而是利用驿站达到我们自己的目的，还能多拿他们一份工钱？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘶……明明做的事情都是一样的，但光是说法变了一下，我心里就一下子好受多了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你们这些聪明人还真是可怕。和你们在一起，该不会我被卖了还要帮你们数钱吧？[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"如果有这种事，我会帮你注意的。","tag":"tag_21"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]那我就放心啦。你肯定是不会坑我的！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]很好，这样一来，无敌的米托拉大人又减少了一个破绽！[r]既然决定了接下来的方针，那我们就赶快行动起来吧！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我们去找那位迦南队长聊聊吧。","tag":"tag_23"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]好！我看看……找到啦，她就在那面桌子附近！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"向菲尔德蕾询问后，商量目标"}